[{"s":1795844249,"e":1795846144,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"No unfair situation can block God's blessings; if one stays in faith, he will show out.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E98"},{"s":1795846144,"e":1795847992,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Your life will follow your thoughts As a believer you should renew your thoughts to how God thinks about you.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2026E14"},{"s":1795847992,"e":1795849827,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God doesn't abandon people when they fall; he picks them up; believing in His redemption.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E369"},{"s":1795849827,"e":1795851681,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God can see things we can't see. Obedience to God will sometimes defy our understanding of situations.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2026E09"},{"s":1795851681,"e":1795853567,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Not letting words hold people back; uplifting others; God will guide people to their true destiny.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E368"},{"s":1795853567,"e":1795855425,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Just as a seed needs water, God's promises need believers' faith to grow; standing in faith for Him.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E120"},{"s":1795855425,"e":1795857310,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel says that God has set aside special times; getting ready for a new season of His favor.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E174"},{"s":1795857310,"e":1795859196,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel says that one's past doesn't disqualify them from God's goodness.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E138"},{"s":1795859196,"e":1795861071,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Faith empowers individuals to overcome life's challenges and emerge stronger.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E352"},{"s":1795861071,"e":1795862921,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Learning how emptying the negativity leads to the God filling one's life with good things.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E386"},{"s":1795862921,"e":1795864823,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel says that when God creates people, He crowns them with favor to defeat every obstacle.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E166"},{"s":1795864823,"e":1795866730,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Feeling at a disadvantage, but God is about to supercharge dreams and make the impossible possible.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E129"},{"s":1795866730,"e":1795868555,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Trusting in God's promises for a brighter future.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E307"},{"s":1795868555,"e":1795870414,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Unfair things may happen, but God hasn't forgotten anyone; breakthroughs and favors are coming.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E237"},{"s":1795870414,"e":1795872259,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Uncomfortable situations often precede greatness; embracing growth by responding to challenges.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E188"},{"s":1795872259,"e":1795874069,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Remembering that people are in the middle of a miracle; the best days are still ahead.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E252"},{"s":1795874069,"e":1795875956,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God talks about you to other people; He speaks to people you may not even know.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E28"},{"s":1795875956,"e":1795877859,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God has already accepted and approved of everybody; one must remind themselves who He says they are.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E02"},{"s":1795877859,"e":1795879724,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"As believers God gives us a fire to push us through the tough times. To rise up and overcome them.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2026E11"},{"s":1795879724,"e":1795881597,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"When God blesses someone, He marks them for greatness; they represent God's goodness.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E224"},{"s":1795881597,"e":1795883453,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel says that when God lays out the plan for one's life, He lines up everything they need.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E169"},{"s":1795883453,"e":1795885332,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Setbacks represent attacks on one's potential, but God works behind the scenes.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E116"},{"s":1795885332,"e":1795887195,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel invites to stay on the high road.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E39"},{"s":1795887195,"e":1795889086,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Difficult seasons aren't final; rising again to places beyond imagination.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E262"},{"s":1795889086,"e":1795890959,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God rewards unwavering dedication and trust in His timing.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E345"},{"s":1795890959,"e":1795892844,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Believe that God's wisdom surpasses our understanding and leads us toward a purposeful life.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2026E21"},{"s":1795892844,"e":1795894723,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Choosing wise inner circles matters; it leads to wisdom and fulfills God-given potential.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E72"},{"s":1795894723,"e":1795896611,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"No unfair situation blocks destiny; God turns what is meant for harm into advantage.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E91"},{"s":1795896611,"e":1795898497,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"What God has planned for you is more rewarding than you can imagine.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E10"},{"s":1795898497,"e":1795900344,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"As believes if we keep abiding in God, He will cause us to remain, even in life's most challenging times","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S01E11"},{"s":1795900344,"e":1795902225,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"To get increase on the outside, you first have to make room on the inside. Believe God can do the impossible.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S02E17"},{"s":1795902225,"e":1795904116,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Many people suffer from destination disease, they stagnate. God's plans is to always be learning and growing.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S03E10"},{"s":1795904116,"e":1795906006,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"In waiting seasons, God is rebooting people for new things; embracing His plan.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E216"},{"s":1795906006,"e":1795907844,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel Osteen explains how God makes His favor visible, turning ordinary lives into undeniable proof.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S16E39"},{"s":1795907844,"e":1795909702,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God created people to shine and make a difference; they must not hide their gifts due to fear.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E258"},{"s":1795909702,"e":1795911593,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"We all need to keep daily reminders of what God has promised us, so as to not get distracted by everyday life.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S03E08"},{"s":1795911593,"e":1795913469,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Staying in faith; God is using setbacks to move people forward in His plan.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E52"},{"s":1795913469,"e":1795915365,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Sometimes, people ask too small; daring to pray for the uncommon and believing for more.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E53"},{"s":1795915365,"e":1795917244,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"With an attitude of faith, even without all the answers, God shows up in different ways.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E111"},{"s":1795917244,"e":1795919099,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Dwelling on past pain keeps a person stuck; letting it go as the future matters more.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E202"},{"s":1795919099,"e":1795920986,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"There is something God put in you that makes you stand out and over come life's challenges and push on.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S01E19"},{"s":1795920986,"e":1795922817,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"The God's work behind the scenes.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E26"},{"s":1795922817,"e":1795924706,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"As a believer our faith has to be unshakeable. Our confidence in God has to be bigger than any problem.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S02E18"},{"s":1795924706,"e":1795926569,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Its easy to get use to our short comings and even defend them. It takes courage to rise above and grow.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S16E20"},{"s":1795926569,"e":1795928452,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"None of us got to where we are by ourselves. Take time to show appreciation to those people who helped you.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S01E16"},{"s":1795928452,"e":1795930356,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Focusing on the past can make a person miss what God is doing now; never overlooking blessings.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E107"},{"s":1795930356,"e":1795932247,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"As believers God has put a frame or boundary around our lives. Nothing gets in without God's approval.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S02E19"},{"s":1795930356,"e":1795932247,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"As believers God has put a frame or boundary around our lives. Nothing gets in without God's approval.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S02E19"},{"s":1795932247,"e":1795934130,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Reclaiming joy, passion and confidence through faith and intentionality.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E353"},{"s":1795934130,"e":1795936021,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"As believers our thoughts should be focused on what Gods says about us and who we should be.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S01E07"},{"s":1795936021,"e":1795937907,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"As believers God allows uncomfortable situations in our lives. These show area's that still need work.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S02E20"},{"s":1795937907,"e":1795939771,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God has called believers to rise above the noise of hate and distrust. We must choose to put on love daily.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S16E09"},{"s":1795939771,"e":1795941668,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel explains that sometimes, breakthroughs comes from helping others.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E29"},{"s":1795941668,"e":1795943557,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Feeling unseen or overlooked, but never forgotten by God; God wants to heal and restore people.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E154"},{"s":1795943557,"e":1795945418,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God goes before people, arranging blessings in their favor to take them further than they can.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E225"},{"s":1795945418,"e":1795947276,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Words are powerful weapons; aligning them with God's truth and getting in agreement with Him.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E256"},{"s":1795947276,"e":1795949129,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Each new day starts before dawn; trusting that victory is coming and breakthrough is on the horizon.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E280"},{"s":1795949129,"e":1795950997,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"When believers fail, God meets them with mercy, not judgment; no mistake is too great for His grace.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E106"},{"s":1795950997,"e":1795952878,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Overcoming challenges can lead to abundant blessings and greater rewards in life.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E301"},{"s":1795952878,"e":1795954769,"t":"Joel Osteen 