od Live with Joel and Victoria","d":"Join Joel and Victoria for live Sunday worship.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/48d0aeb5503f15876ccd8ac2898f8131/rokuFeed/assets/575826905bef5ffba11ed092cf80b0d6.png"},{"s":1795980000,"e":1795981102,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Talking about the reasons behind facing obstacles.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E24"},{"s":1795981102,"e":1795982984,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"One must learn the habit of praising God and having gratitude, as these are what release His favor.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E03"},{"s":1795982984,"e":1795984848,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"We all face challenges we think we can't overcome; God will send help to overcome them.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E42"},{"s":1795984848,"e":1795986708,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Letting feelings rule limits people's potential; choosing discipline.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E362"},{"s":1795986708,"e":1795988595,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God wants to uplift destiny; don't let excuses keep you from the new things He has.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E130"},{"s":1795988595,"e":1795994158,"t":"Full Service: Favor That You Can See","d":"Joel Osteen explains how God makes His favor visi