oes","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S02E05"},{"s":1796009791,"e":1796011650,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel says that God is counting on everyone to represent His love and make a difference.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E179"},{"s":1796011650,"e":1796013554,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Words are powerful; speak in faith to invite God's blessings, favor and abundance into one's life.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E36"},{"s":1796013554,"e":1796015433,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Favor is a free gift that can't be earned. Pray boldly and expectantly to see God show up in your life!","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S05E02"},{"s":1796015433,"e":1796017318,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"No one is limited by their past or others' opinions; god counts everyone worthy.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E146"},{"s":1796017318,"e":1796019197,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Happiness isn't dictated by circumstances; God's continual joy is always available.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E159"},{"s":1796017318,"e":1796019197,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Happiness isn't dictated by circumstances; God's continual joy is always available.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E159"},{"s":1796019197,"e":1796021088,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Choices can impact a family for generations; God has generational blessings.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E64"},{"s":1796021088,"e":1796022986,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel on how people's words shape their future; negativity won't lead to a positive life or victory.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E321"},{"s":1796022986,"e":1796024840,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God's timing is perfect; He hasn't forgotten anyone, staying in faith.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E272"},{"s":1796024840,"e":1796026708,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"As a believer the same power that raised Christ from the dead now dwells in us but we must believe.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2026E16"},{"s":1796026708,"e":1796028554,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"As a believer God's blessing in our lives will bring resistance and persecution. They go together.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S16E17"},{"s":1796028554,"e":1796030443,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God is about to shift things in favor of people; they are not going to be limited.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E279"},{"s":1796030443,"e":1796032322,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Setbacks represent attacks on one's potential, but God works behind the scenes.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E116"},{"s":1796032322,"e":1796034210,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Small inconveniences do not steal joy; protecting the heart's secret place leads to greater peace.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E153"},{"s":1796034210,"e":1796036093,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"It's not too late to pursue your God-given dream; Delays mean God is working behind the scenes.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E390"},{"s":1796036093,"e":1796037983,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"To experience breakthroughs, one adopts a quick mentality; God can shift things in a person's favor.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E136"},{"s":1796037983,"e":1796039880,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"People must prioritize self-care to better embrace all that God has for them.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E317"},{"s":1796039880,"e":1796041769,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"This is not the time to give up; this is the time to stir up faith.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E09"},{"s":1796041769,"e":1796043647,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Learning the importance of celebrating one's small victories along the way towards unmet goals.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E383"},{"s":1796043647,"e":1796045533,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Instead of counting on people, one must learn to count on God.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E40"},{"s":1796045533,"e":1796047374,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"One's value comes from the Heavenly Father, not people; seeing oneself as God sees one.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E44"},{"s":1796047374,"e":1796049234,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Letting feelings rule limits people's potential; choosing discipline.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E362"},{"s":1796049234,"e":1796051102,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"The words we speak create an atmosphere. When our words are praise it opens Heaven and God responds.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S16E18"},{"s":1796051102,"e":1796052966,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God has called believers to 