ekly","d":"Words of wisdom and family stories honoring Joel Osteen's mom, Dodie Osteen.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E44"},{"s":1796064183,"e":1796066047,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"We all face challenges we think we can't overcome; God will send help to overcome them.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E42"},{"s":1796066047,"e":1796067937,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Each of us has a lion and a lamb on the inside; we are to draw from each temperament.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E48"},{"s":1796067937,"e":1796069819,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Not waiting for fulfillment; letting gratitude for God's blessings bring contentment.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E338"},{"s":1796069819,"e":1796071672,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Everyone experiences periods of waiting and feeling excluded.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E59"},{"s":1796071672,"e":1796073550,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God promotes people who use their talents to help others rise.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E126"},{"s":1796073550,"e":1796075412,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God knew every situation you would ever face. He put in you everything you need to fulfill your purpose.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S16E19"},{"s":1796075412,"e":1796077300,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"At times, trusting God means believing without signs; God works behind the scenes.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E292"},{"s":1796077300,"e":1796079148,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Your life will follow your thoughts As a believer you should renew your thoughts to how God thinks about you.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2026E14"},{"s":1796079148,"e":1796081043,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God has already ordained the relationships needed to fulfill one's destiny.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E13"},{"s":1796081043,"e":1796082850,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Thoughts shape life; focusing on God's promises and His strength will empower people to overcome.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E260"},{"s":1796082850,"e":1796084754,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Discussing how a healthy soul allows God's grace to help one flourish.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E285"},{"s":1796084754,"e":1796086644,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"What 